## Execution Method

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Research will be delegated to sub-agents that write their findings directly into the numbered folders. I (Antigravity) will then read, validate, and assemble the deliverables. This follows the bootstrap.md pattern: Antigravity orchestrates → CLI/agents execute → outputs are validated.

### Execution Order
1. Create folder structure inside `Task001/`
2. **Phase 1 research** → populate `01/` and begin `02/` (ICMA matrix + SIDS)
3. **Phase 2 research** → populate `03/` and complete `02/` (gap analysis)
4. Assemble **Deliverable 1** (Inception Note) from Phase 1 outputs
5. **Phase 3 analysis** → populate `04/`
6. Assemble **Deliverable 2** (Legal Review Report)
7. Assemble **Deliverable 3** (Final Assessment & Roadmap)

